{"strongs": "H3715", "word": "כְּפִיר", "translit": "ke.phir", "root": "כפר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "young lion", "definition": "כְּפִיר noun masculine young lion ; — ׳ כ Judg 14:5 + 16 t.; plural כְּפִרִים Jer 2:15 + 3 t.; כְּפִירִים Zech 11:3 + 7 t.; suffix כְּפִירַיִךְ Nah 2:14 כְּפִירֶיהָ Ezek 38:13 ( Co reads כנעניה ); — literal אֲרָיוֺת ׳ כ Judg 14:5 young lion of lions ; Amos 3:4 ; Ps 17:12 . It differs from whelp גּוּר Ezek 19:2 ; Ezek 19:3 as old enough to hunt its prey, Jer 25:38 ; Isa 11:6 ; Zech 11:3 ; Ps 104:21 in simile of roar of hostile army Isa 5:29 ׅ || (לָבִיא compare Jer 51:38 ׅ || (גּוֺרֵי אריות ; sim of ׳ י 's invincible might Isa 31:4 ׅ || (אַרְיֵה ; of Israel among the nations, Mic 5:7 of Assyr. princes Nah 2:12 of prince of Israel Ezek 19:5 ; Ezek 19:6 other cases are: || לָבִיא Job 38:39 || שַׁחַל Hos 5:14 ; Ps 91:13 ; Job 4:10 of bloodthirsty enemies Ps 34:11 ; Ps 35:17 ; Ps 58:7 ; Jer 2:15 גוים ׳ כ Ezek 32:2 , of young warriors Nah 2:14 ; Ezek 38:13 (?; see Co above); righteous compared with, Prov 28:1 king's wrath like roaring of, Prov 19:12 ; Prov 20:2 of one of faces of cherubim Ezek 41:19 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4162')\">BDB4162</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3715')\">H3715</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4161')\">BDB4161</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4163')\">BDB4163</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כְּפִיר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>young lion</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 14:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,14,5)\">Judg 14:5</ref> + 16 t.; plural <bdbheb>כְּפִרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 2:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,15)\">Jer 2:15</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>כְּפִירִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"